### Variables - adjust if the app runs on a different port
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1) First event for a new shipment -> APPLIED, 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/shipment-events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "evt-123",
  "partner": "dhl",
  "shipmentId": "ship-456",
  "status": "IN_TRANSIT",
  "occurredAt": "2026-03-10T12:00:00Z",
  "receivedAt": "2026-03-10T12:00:05Z",
  "location": "CapeTown"
}

### 2) Exact resubmission of the same eventId -> DUPLICATE, 200, payloadMismatch:false
POST {{baseUrl}}/shipment-events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "evt-123",
  "partner": "dhl",
  "shipmentId": "ship-456",
  "status": "IN_TRANSIT",
  "occurredAt": "2026-03-10T12:00:00Z",
  "receivedAt": "2026-03-10T12:00:05Z",
  "location": "CapeTown"
}

### 3) Later event, different status -> APPLIED, becomes the new ruling event
POST {{baseUrl}}/shipment-events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "evt-129",
  "partner": "dhl",
  "shipmentId": "ship-456",
  "status": "OUT_FOR_DELIVERY",
  "occurredAt": "2026-03-10T14:00:00Z",
  "receivedAt": "2026-03-10T14:00:05Z"
}

### 4) Earlier event arriving late -> STALE, 201, current status unchanged
POST {{baseUrl}}/shipment-events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "evt-050",
  "partner": "dhl",
  "shipmentId": "ship-456",
  "status": "HANDED_TO_CARRIER",
  "occurredAt": "2026-03-10T08:00:00Z",
  "receivedAt": "2026-03-10T08:00:05Z"
}

### 5) Missing required field ("partner") -> INVALID, 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/shipment-events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "evt-bad",
  "shipmentId": "ship-456",
  "status": "IN_TRANSIT",
  "occurredAt": "2026-03-10T12:00:00Z",
  "receivedAt": "2026-03-10T12:00:05Z"
}

### 6) Current state for the shipment built up above
GET {{baseUrl}}/shipments/ship-456

### 7) Full ordered history for that shipment
GET {{baseUrl}}/shipments/ship-456/events

### 8) Unknown shipment -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/shipments/ship-does-not-exist
